  'Felonious Assault Charges',
  'Assault With a Dangerous Weapon Charges',
  'Assault With Intent to Commit Great Bodily Harm Charges',
  'Assault By Strangulation Charges',
  'Assault With Intent To Maim Charges',
  'Assault With Intent to Murder Charges',
  'Self Defense',
  'Defense of Others',
